<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Komercni Q1 1997 net CZK 1.043 BLN.</title>
<headline>Czech Komercni Q1 1997 net CZK 1.043 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The largest Czech commercial bank Komercni banka a.s. said on Wednesday its first quarter 1997 net profit had fallen to 1.043 billion crowns from 1.348 billion in the same period last year, according to international accounting standards.</p>
<p>According to Czech accounting, Komercni's net profit in the first quarter fell to 0.867 billion crowns from 1.359 billion.  </p>
<p>Full results will be announced later in the day.</p>
<p>-- Robin Shepherd, Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
